        <mxCell id="gadumWXtAf7965I1yshn-0" parent="GA0EpARBnaVGhhuHxsgY-66" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 24px 0px 12px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 28px; font-family: &amp;quot;YS Geo&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, &amp;quot;Arial Unicode MS&amp;quot;, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); letter-spacing: 0.208px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 35px;&quot;&gt;Клавиши&amp;nbsp; динамической подгрузки контента (SPA‑подход)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 8px 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 28px; font-family: &amp;quot;YS Geo&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, &amp;quot;Arial Unicode MS&amp;quot;, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); letter-spacing: 0.208px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 35px;&quot;&gt;Как это работает:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 16px 0px; padding-left: 24px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Geo&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, &amp;quot;Arial Unicode MS&amp;quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.208px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 8px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 8px 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 35px;&quot;&gt;Существует одна главная страница (например,&amp;nbsp;&lt;code class=&quot;CodeInlined Markdown-Word&quot; style=&quot;display: inline; padding: 3px 8px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 22px; font-family: Consolas, Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&amp;quot;, monospace, sans-serif; vertical-align: middle; white-space-collapse: preserve; tab-size: 4; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7); border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; border-radius: 8px; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252); animation: 0.3s ease-out 0s 1 normal none running markdown-word-fade;&quot;&gt;gallery.html&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 8px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 8px 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 35px;&quot;&gt;Категории представлены кнопками // ссылками, которые не перезагружают страницу, а запускают скрипт.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 8px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 8px 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 35px;&quot;&gt;Скрипт (на JavaScript) подгружает данные (фотографии и отзывы) для выбранной категории и динамически обновляет содержимое галереи без перезагрузки страницы.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 8px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 8px 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 35px;&quot;&gt;URL может меняться с помощью History API (например,&amp;nbsp;&lt;code class=&quot;CodeInlined Markdown-Word&quot; style=&quot;display: inline; padding: 3px 8px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 22px; font-family: Consolas, Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&amp;quot;, monospace, sans-serif; vertical-align: middle; white-space-collapse: preserve; tab-size: 4; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7); border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; border-radius: 8px; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252); animation: 0.3s ease-out 0s 1 normal none running markdown-word-fade;&quot;&gt;site.com/gallery#office&lt;/code&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;code class=&quot;CodeInlined Markdown-Word&quot; style=&quot;display: inline; padding: 3px 8px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 22px; font-family: Consolas, Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&amp;quot;, monospace, sans-serif; vertical-align: middle; white-space-collapse: preserve; tab-size: 4; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7); border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; border-radius: 8px; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252); animation: 0.3s ease-out 0s 1 normal none running markdown-word-fade;&quot;&gt;site.com/gallery#sport&lt;/code&gt;), сохраняя возможность делиться ссылкой на конкретную категорию.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
